OL,3,AFive killed and 67 injured in Russian
OL,4,Astrike on shopping centre, Ukraine says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainian officials say five people
OL,7,Fwere killed and 67 others were wounded
OL,8,Fwhen a Russian drone hit a shopping
OL,9,Fmall in Pavlohrad, a city in
OL,10,FDnipropetrovsk region.
OL,12,FShops and vehicles were hit in the
OL,13,Fdaylight attack which took place "when
OL,14,Fthe streets were full of people",
OL,15,FInterior Minister Ivan Vyhivskyi said.
OL,17,FTwo other shopping malls - in the
OL,18,Fcities of Zaporizhzhia and Sumy - were
OL,19,Ftargeted by Russian air strikes earlier
OL,20,Fthis week, according to Ukrainian
OL,21,Fmedia.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
